name: sim.getShapeBB
description: Returns the size and relative pose of a shape's bounding box
luaSynopsis: list size, list pose = sim.getShapeBB(int shapeHandle)
pythonSynopsis: float[3] size, float[7] pose = sim.getShapeBB(int shapeHandle)
inputs:
1. shapeHandle: handle of the shape
outputs:
1. size: size array [Sx Sy Sz]
2. pose: pose array: [x y z qx qy qz qw]. The pose is relative to the shape's pose
replacedBy:
- name: dimension, class: shape, file: shape_dimension.property
